{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06788","headline":"赠宇文中丞 · 王昌龄","name":"赠宇文中丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仆本濩落人，辱当州郡使。\n量力颇及早，谢归今即已。\n萧萧若凌虚，衿带顷消靡。\n车服卒然来，涔阳作游子。\n郁郁寡开颜，默默独行李。\n忽逢平生友，一笑方在此。\n秋清宁风日，楚思浩云水。\n爲语弋林者，冥冥鸿远矣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06788.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06788","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}